  "description": "In love with his stepbrother but slowly being pushed away. 20-year-old Yeon-U cries out. \"Why does Do-Gyeong hate me now?\" While deep in drunken thought, a strange man approaches. This man, Seo-Jin... starts hitting on him?! And later that very night, Yeon-U dreams pf another life where he's actually a princess. If Yeon-U's the princess, then who is this Henan that the princess so loves? \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
